flowchart TD
    Start([User opens login page]) --> Method{Which method?}

    Method -->|Google| GSignIn[Trigger Google sign-in]
    GSignIn --> GCallback[NextAuth OAuth callback]
    GCallback --> GExists{User exists in database?}
    GExists -->|No| GCreate[Auto-create user]
    GExists -->|Yes| GLink[Link Google account]
    GCreate --> GSession[Create JWT session]
    GLink --> GSession
    GSession --> GDone([Redirect to /dashboard])

    Method -->|Email and password| ESubmit[Submit credentials]
    ESubmit --> EValidate{Payload valid?}
    EValidate -->|No| E400[Return validation error]
    E400 --> EShow400([Show form errors])

    EValidate -->|Yes| EUser{User exists and has password?}
    EUser -->|No| E401A[Return invalid credentials]
    E401A --> EShow401([Show login error])

    EUser -->|Yes| EPw{Password correct?}
    EPw -->|No| E401B[Return invalid credentials]
    E401B --> EShow401
    EPw -->|Yes| ESession[Create JWT session]
    ESession --> EDone([Redirect to /dashboard])
